alogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:02.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Cevabımı bulamıyorum. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.01,0:01:08.40,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Bu yüzden ilerlemeye devam edeceğim. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:11.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Gel hadi, gidelim. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.03,0:01:14.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Asla pes etmeyeceğiz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:19.48,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Zamanın dalgalarına yenik düşmeyeceğiz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:25.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Tekrar tekrar ayağa kalkacağız. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.10,0:01:30.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Çünkü bizim için önemli olanı kaybetmek istemiyoruz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:35.85,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Beni sürekli, sürekli ilerlemeye zorlayan... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:41.25,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ ...kafamdaki sesi duyabiliyorum. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:46.38,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Haylaz yağmur bana engel olurken bile... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:51.32,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ ...kaçmaya çalışmayacağım. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:56.78,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Gel hadi, gidelim. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:02:00.06,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Asla pes etmeyeceğiz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:05.35,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Zamanın dalgalarına yenik düşmeyeceğiz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:10.99,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Tekrar tekrar ayağa kalkacağız. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:16.35,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Çünkü bizim için önemli olanı kaybetmek istemiyoruz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:22.05,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ İnandığımız geleceğe doğru ilerleyelim. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:30.30,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:35.64,Credits,,0,0,0,,Quality Assurance Galaxy 9000 PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:42.21,Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke & Attack Effects KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:46.10,Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:46.91,0:00:49.53,Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.40,Credits,,0,0,0,,Raw Provider CruchyrollDialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:41.65,Author,,0,0,0,, Türkçeleştirme  onepacetr.netDialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:48.00,Author,,0,0,0,, Türkçeleştirme  onepacetr.netDialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:18.00,Author,,0,0,0,, Türkçeleştirme  onepacetr.netDialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:34.75,Title,,0,0,220,,Adalet Kazanacak!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:37.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Hemen idam sehpasına!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:41.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Devler timi geliyor!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:45.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oz Jr.'ı hedef alıyorlar!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:50.46,Main,,0,0,0,,O şeyi durdurmak...Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.05,Main,,0,0,0,,...bizim görevimiz!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:58.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Büyüklüğü inanılmaz!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:03:01.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Sıradan bir devin en az iki katı büyüklüğünde!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:02.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Ateşe devam!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:05.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Sadece kandan ve etten... Zarar görmeyecek değil ya!Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:21.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Okkalı bir müttefik getirmişler.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Ateş! Vurun onu!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:29.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oz! Unut gitsin!Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:33.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Büyüklüğün seni kolay hedef haline getiriyor!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:35.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Senin için geliyorum!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:56.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Durum kötü!Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:57.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Durdurun onu!Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:16.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Oz, koya doğru yol açtı!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:21.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Koyu istila edin!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:30.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,OzDialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:30.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,MeydanDialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:30.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,Yedi  Savaş LorduDialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:33.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Geri çekilin! Kıyı şeridinde tahkimat yapın!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:34.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Meydana ulaşmalarına izin vermeyin!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Daha önce kimseye böyle bakmak zorunda kalmamıştım!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:47.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten!Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Yolun buraya kadarmış!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Koramiral Lacroix!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Oz... Onu tutmaya çalışmanın manası yok.Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:22.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Kahraman olmakla hayatını boş yere harcamak arasında fark vardır!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Babalık, lütfen beni durdurma!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:30.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Onu kurtarmak istiyorum!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.11,0:05:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace-kun'u en kısa sürede kurtarmak istiyorum!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Anladım.Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Beyler! Kıpırdayın bakalım! Oz'a biraz destek verelim!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:45.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:53.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar büyük biriyle nasıl dövüşeceğiz?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.37,0:06:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Koramiral Lacroix'e zarar vermeye nasıl cüret edersin?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:23.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Oz dikkatini dağıttıysa, seni haklayacağım!Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.14,0:06:30.64,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,SDialogue: 1,0:06:30.18,0:06:30.64,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 1,0:06:30.22,0:06:30.64,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:06:30.64,0:06:31.36,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,SlaDialogue: 1,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.06,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,vDialogue: 1,0:06:30.30,0:06:31.06,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:06:31.06,0:06:31.66,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,veDialogue: 1,0:06:30.34,0:06:31.36,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 1,0:06:30.38,0:06:31.36,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:06:31.36,0:06:31.87,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,ArDialogue: 1,0:06:30.42,0:06:31.57,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.57,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:06:30.50,0:06:31.57,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 1,0:06:31.57,0:06:32.30,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rowDialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:32.30,Note,,0,0,0,,- Köle Oku -Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:44.49,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Beyler!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:47.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanırım Korsan İmparatoriçesi.Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.33,0:06:54.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Bedenim... parçalanıyor?!Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.82,0:06:55.32,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,PDialogue: 1,0:06:54.86,0:06:55.32,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:06:54.90,0:06:55.32,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:06:55.32,0:06:55.86,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,PerDialogue: 1,0:06:54.94,0:06:55.56,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,fDialogue: 1,0:06:54.98,0:06:55.56,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 1,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.07,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,fuDialogue: 1,0:06:55.02,0:06:55.77,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:06:55.06,0:06:55.77,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:06:55.77,0:06:56.59,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 1,0:06:55.10,0:06:56.29,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,FDialogue: 1,0:06:55.14,0:06:56.29,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:06:56.29,0:06:56.78,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,FeDialogue: 1,0:06:55.18,0:06:56.48,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:06:55.22,0:06:56.48,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 1,0:06:56.48,0:06:56.88,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 1,0:06:55.26,0:06:56.58,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:06:56.58,0:06:57.11,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:57.11,Note,,0,0,0,,- Parfüm Uyluk Kemiği -Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:15.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Pislik! Denizcilere saldırarak ne yaptığını sanıyorsun?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:19.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal'a karşı dövüşmeyi kabul ettim,...Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:22.52,Main,,0,0,0,,...ama müttefiğiniz olacağımı hiç söylemedim.Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:26.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Dost ya da düşman olsun, tüm erkekler aynı!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.41,0:07:29.24,Main,,0,0,0,,O hariç tüm erkekler.Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Sözümü tutmuş olarak buradan gitmek istiyorum.Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:35.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Ne diyorsun?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:42.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Bu güzelliği bağışlayabilir misiniz?Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sen...!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:00.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Sen!Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:20.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Şimdi seni kurtaracağım!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:22.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Oz...Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:56.20,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,UDialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:56.20,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:08:56.20,0:08:56.83,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,UrDialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:57.84,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,UrDialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:56.63,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:56.63,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:56.63,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:08:56.63,0:08:57.35,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,susDialogue: 0,0:08:56.73,0:08:57.84,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,susDialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.15,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,SDialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.15,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.15,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:08:57.15,0:08:57.73,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,ShoDialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:57.84,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,ShoDialogue: 0,0:08:56.29,0:08:57.53,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 0,0:08:56.29,0:08:57.53,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:08:57.53,0:08:58.04,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,ckDialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:08:57.84,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,ckDialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:57.84,Note,,0,0,0,,- Ayı Şoku -Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.57,0:09:18.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Oz!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:31.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Bu kadarı yeter! Kes şunu!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Buraya kadar gelmeyi başaramazsın!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:38.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Ben mi?Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:45.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Nasıl yapıldığını Wano Şehri'nde öğrendim.Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:47.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Dene bakalım!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.16,0:09:53.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Ace-san o şapkayı yapmaya çalışırken lanet şeyi iki kez yaktı.Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:56.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Onun gibi bir ateş adam hasır örmemeli.Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:03.18,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Vaaay! Şimdi daha serin!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:05.95,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Öyle mi? Harika!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Oz'u hedef alın!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:30.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Oz!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:32.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanırım hiç şansı yoktu.Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:33.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Açık hedef durumunda!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:42.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Oz!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Dışarıda ne yapıyorsunuz?Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:49.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Yağmurda bile ıslanmıyorum.Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:52.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten sağlam.Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:55.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Bu harika!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:02.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Hiç olmazsa...Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:06.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Savaş Lordları'ndan biri bile olsa...Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:28.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Bir sorun mu var, şeytan?Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:30.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Bacaklarım...Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:32.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Kaptan!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:37.62,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Kaptan! Neden yine dışarıdasın?Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:41.11,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Kar bile bana ulaşamıyor.Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:44.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hiç üşümüyorum!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:47.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Bu gerçekten iyi!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:50.42,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sağol, Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:01.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar eğlenceli!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:09.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oz!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Bu canavar!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:35.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Meydana doğru bir gedik açtı!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:46.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Sadece biraz daha...Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.07,0:12:54.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace'e sadece biraz daha...Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Lanet Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Bacağının birini kesti!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Cesedi istiyorum dememe rağmen.Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.56,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,m 12 0 b 25 0 22 13 12 13 b 2 13 2 0 12 0 DDialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.56,Moria,,0,